==Russian==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|sla-pro|ru}} {{term/t|sla-pro|*govьno}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ɡɐv'no/|lang=ru}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun|говно́|g=n}}

# {{context|uncountable|vulgar|lang=ru}} [[shit]]
# {{context|vulgar|lang=ru}} [[shit]], [[shitass]], [[turd]] ''(worthless person)''
# {{context|vulgar|lang=ru}} [[crap]], [[junk]] ''(worthless thing)''
# {{context|uncountable|vulgar|lang=ru}} [[bullshit]] ''(nonsense)''
#: * {{lang|ru|говно́ [[собачий|соба́чье]]}} — ''dog shit (person or thing)''
#: * {{lang|ru|[[свой|Своё]] говно́ не [[вонять|воня́ет]]}}! — ''One’s own shit doesn’t stink!''
#: * {{lang|ru|Не [[трогать|тро́нь]] говно́, а то воня́ть [[быть|бу́дет]]}}! — ''Shit doesn’t stink until you pester it!''

====Declension====
{{ru-noun-inan-о-4|говн|го́вн|говён|говён}}

